51449_3374706867984337533_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8NpIaPQYBgcQ7kNvwHS8N3r&_nc_oc=AdodmSUjxFStM7z38x-_kOVQUWGyqxhTsjZ0EFFVAyuX1bWRKCVkhP4C7Mj-y61e6jA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRwgMabis03iKOdkAobEous0_OEocmr_SDWdJz10GI5dA&oe=6B0DA9AE"}, {"file_name": "Untitledc Design.png", "id": "1460267288830935", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908842198_1460267292164268_3972213603207145217_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dcxku37n4hUQ7kNvwEL-v30&_nc_oc=AdrcTfFyaAeDZ9iR-88mvO11qrRUJN0bni1JrJwpuNeAyPlEBwtTDv1J22wmhB9rC6A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQHQu6K09Z7xqFGoEL9ExLCTTuK4TwmKVy_2Z7692wqPQ&oe=6B0DB878"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Rigimore", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# RIGIMORE\n\n**Enter the darkness. Face your fears. Become the Monster.**\n\nWelcome to **RIGIMORE**, an immersive VR horror experience featuring terrifying environments, intense encounters, and multiple ways to experience the fear.\n\nExplore a variety of detailed, atmospheric maps, each with its own unique setting, atmosphere, and horrors waiting to be discovered.\n\n### BECOME THE MONSTER\nTurn the tables and become the creature hunting everyone else. Experience the thrill of being the monster and chasing down other players.\n\n### NORMAL HORROR\nExplore, survive, and uncover the terrifying mysteries hidden throughout each environment.\n\n### PARKING GARAGE\nNavigate a dark, abandoned parking structure where every corner could hide something watching you.\n\n### THE CAVE\nDescend into the darkness of an underground cave. Watch your surroundings and don't get lost.\n\n### THE FOREST\nExplore an eerie forest filled with unsettling atmosphere and unexpected encounters.\n\n### THE FACILITY\nEnter a mysterious facility where something has gone terribly wrong. Discover what's inside, if you can survive.\n\n### BUILT FOR IMMERSION\n- Amazing visual quality and detailed environments.\n- Atmospheric lighting and immersive surroundings.\n- VR-focused movement and gameplay.\n- Multiple horror experiences.\n- Multiplayer gameplay.\n- Become the Monster game mode.\n- Unique environments to explore.\n\n**The darkness is waiting. The question is... will you survive RIGIMORE?**\n{2240893986472077}", "short_description": "# RIGIMORE\n\n**Enter the darkness. Face your fears. Become the Monster.**\n\nWelcome to **RIGIMORE**, an immersive VR horror experience featuring terrifying environments, intense encounters, and multiple ways to experience the fear.\n\nExplore a variety of detailed, atmospheric maps, each with its own unique setting, atmosphere, and horrors waiting to be discovered.\n"}]}, "developer_name": "NorthernAttom", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/rigimore/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "pinko", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.northernattom.world/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1369484886257298"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908835844_1133903082575003_7018255